      "review_description": "Sales upsold a sightly better system so that they can install some panels north and the remaining west.Installer arrived with instructions to put everything on the west. After some chat I got explained why it can't go north (too small load on that string) abs we still had to proceed with all-west.That was a major disappointment as I specifically asked sales to ensure we can get some on the north side. But I guess I didn't have much choice and will need to see how it'll work out.Still waiting for the inspector to come it and unfortunately I have 0 expert limit.",
